frame; \code{brimmest()} settles a reported tuple exactly. Companion functions
trace the feasible envelope (\code{sd_bounds_curve()}), build the jointly GRIM-,
GRIMMER- and bounds-consistent grid (\code{umbrella_data()}), and visualise both
(\code{plot_sd_bounds()}, \code{plot_sd_bounds_pomp()}, \code{plot_umbrella()}).
